  - R-4: each skin has its HUD_FACE, all seven faces are registered in Media, and WoW Default sets Friz Quadrata explicitly.
  - R-5 / D-01 / D-02: S.Text takes { panel = true }, ReorderList is panel-scoped by default, and every owned Widgets constructor takes opts.panel. Windows ignore the panel switch, and the hooks stand down through rec.panelOff. SetIgnore repaints and fires the change listeners, so the switch works live in both directions.
  - The rest hold too: R-6 (the FromSkin leaf, plus opts.companions), R-7 and D-14 (gtip.*, new gtip.footer), R-8 (hex / 255), R-9 (public DrawsKey, __DrawsKey kept as an alias) and R-11 (TITLE plus frame.ownerLabel, the window fitted to the label's unbounded width).
- **New tokens:** gtip.footer, icon.grip and list.hoverArt reach the seven other skins through FOLLOW. WoW Default sets false where it should, and eui derives them from Ka0s Default.
- **D-20:** each of the 24 touched payload files moved by exactly one minor, with one new docs version file and member manifest per key (Core 14, DebugLog 22.5.1.2, Options 34.4.36.5.7.11.3.13.9.4.3.6.3.2, Perf 15.1.1.11, Sim 2.3.8, Skin 8.16.12.6.10.2.4, Widgets 17.3.7.5.5.2). The README rows match.
- **Tests fail without each change:** in a scratch copy of the branch (the repo itself untouched) I reverted 25 individual changes one at a time. Every revert made at least one targeted test fail (the scratch harness also flagged an eol case on each edit; I ignored that).
- **Ka0s Default:** it changes only where a ruling or decision says it does (q.*, the retired stock look, Oxanium on newly fonted strings, the tooltip palette, the suggestion rows), with one exception: the drawer chevron (finding 5).

