Findings: [major] LK-A1 (plan-data/addendum-02.tsv, M1 LibKa0s) LibKa0s/SkinPaint.lua:526-533 (P.fontSize), called from P.font at :557: LK-A1 ("P.font never sends a non-positive or non-number size to SetFont") is a planned M1 LibKa0s item that comes from the owner's in-game invalid-font-height error, but no LK-A1 commit is on the branch. The bug is still there. P.fontSize does `stock = tonumber(stock)` and then `if not stock ... return want`. In Lua, 0 is truthy, so a FontString whose GetFont() reports size 0 (a string with no font yet, MultiMeters' meter title in MM-H1) gets `0 * want / ref = 0`, and SetFont(path, 0, flags) raises. Negative sizes get through the same way. This branch adds about fifteen new P.font call sites (S.Font on the DebugLog title-bar labels, PerfPanel and SimPanel rows, the Widgets menu rows and measurer, the autocomplete rows, the chart ticks, the drag-handle label, and P.label on Drawer label and summary), so more strings can hit it. The M1 checkpoint and LK-90 cannot close without it. | [minor] Line-band register (layout-§1 / automated-tests-§4) CLAUDE.md:206-270 (the 1000-1500 band prose): Two files entered the 1000-1500 band on this branch and have no entry: LibKa0s/SkinDefs.lua (959 -> 1005) and tests/test_options_skin_picker.lua (966 -> 1064). Only SimPanel.lua (997 -> 1018) was recorded. Three listed figures are now stale while the section says "every figure below is current": LibKa0s/OptionsIds.lua is 1412 (listed 1378, trigger 1450), LibKa0s/OptionsIdList.lua is 1290 (listed 1268, trigger 1350) and LibKa0s/Skin.lua is 1081 (listed 1044, trigger 1150). No trigger has fired. OptionsTabs (1382) and OptionsWidgets (1447) added no member or maker. | [minor] Consumer impact (LK-90 "What a consumer owes") docs/api/CONSUMERS.md:74-84; docs/api/Skin/version-8.16.12.6.10.2.4-docs.md (no consumer-owes section): The v1.81.0 note names Ka0s Quick Comms and Ka0s Skin Tester as the only consumers that pass the retired stockDefault. DpsRace also d